## Requirements

### `requirements.txt` (core)
```text
PyYAML>=6.0
pillow>=10.0
beautifulsoup4>=4.12
markdownify>=0.11
python-docx>=1.1
lxml>=5.0
edge-tts>=7.0
pymupdf>=1.24
pymupdf4llm>=1.0
srt>=3.5
```

### `requirements-ocr.txt` (optional, for scanned PDFs)
```text
paddleocr>=3.0
paddlepaddle>=3.0
```

### `requirements-llm.txt` (optional, for llama-cpp-python)
```text
llama-cpp-python>=0.2.90
```

> **Note**: PaddleOCR downloads ~500 MB models on first run to `~/.paddleocr/`. Subsequent runs are offline.

